{
  "title": "Second Coming of Solaris (Ultra)/Story",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mbox stub\" style=\"border-left-width:8px;margin-bottom:5px;border-left-color:#d6d6d6;position:relative;display:flex;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid #d6d6d6;min-height:32px\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\" style=\"display:table;padding:8px 15px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;image mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-mbox\" style=\"text-align:center;padding-right:15px;display:table-cell;height:100%;vertical-align:middle;width:40px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e8/Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png/revision/latest?cb=20240703174053\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Baizhi Sticker Slice of Life 01 08\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Baizhi Sticker Slice of Life 01 08.png\" data-image-key=\"Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e8/Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/65?cb=20240703174053\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\" style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\" style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">This <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_Stubs\" title=\"Category:Article Stubs\">page</a> is in need of information.</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-mbox\" style=\"display:block\">Can you help out? <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/Second_Coming_of_Solaris_(Ultra)/Story?action=edit\">Click here to add more.</a></div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-mbox\" title=\"Dismiss\" style=\"color:#bbb;right:0;cursor:pointer;font-size:16px;top:0;transition:all .15s ease-in;position:absolute;padding:2px 7px;font-weight:bold\"></span></div></div></div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Second Coming of Solaris (Ultra)/Story</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Leisure Event</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"chapter\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Event</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Second_Coming_of_Solaris_(Ultra)\" title=\"Second Coming of Solaris (Ultra)\">Second Coming of Solaris (Ultra)</a>[[Category:|000000]]</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Description</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">In Jinzhou, you come across a man who appears to be distressed. He claims to have survived a mysterious attack...</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRewards\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rewards\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"card-list-container\"><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Resonance_Potion\" title=\"Medium Resonance Potion\"><img alt=\"Medium Resonance Potion\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Medium Resonance Potion.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Medium_Resonance_Potion.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d2/Item_Medium_Resonance_Potion.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240524152915\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 2</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Energy_Core\" title=\"Medium Energy Core\"><img alt=\"Medium Energy Core\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Medium Energy Core.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Medium_Energy_Core.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/1/18/Item_Medium_Energy_Core.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240524153056\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 2</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Sealed_Tube\" title=\"Medium Sealed Tube\"><img alt=\"Medium Sealed Tube\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Medium Sealed Tube.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Medium_Sealed_Tube.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/7e/Item_Medium_Sealed_Tube.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240529094325\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 1</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shell_Credit\" title=\"Shell Credit\"><img alt=\"Shell Credit\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Shell Credit.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Shell_Credit.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d1/Item_Shell_Credit.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240523132525\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 3,000</span></span></div></span></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-content\">In Jinzhou, you come across a man who appears to be distressed. He claims to have survived a mysterious attack…</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li>Talk to the man who survived the attack</li></ol>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dt><b>Bertolt</b> Ouch... My teeth...</dt></dl>\n<dl><dd><b>Bertolt</b> Ouch... My teeth...</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> What happened?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Are you hurt?</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> See that lady over there? She got swarmed by Tacet Discords. It took me ages to get her out.</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> She looked nice, you know? Figured she'd at least thank me with a few Shell Credits or Astrites...</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> But no! She kicked me! Right in the teeth!</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Yikes. That sounds rough.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Wait... Why were Tacet Discords in the city?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> What lady? I didn't see anyone.</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> Huh? Wait... is this Jinzhou? Are we not in <span class=\"new\" title=\"Tiancheng (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGlhbmNoZW5nP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Tiancheng</span>? Oh thank goodness, I'm finally back! And you're... (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;), right?</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> Ahem. Sorry for the confusion. I'm Bertolt, a designer on the Second Coming of Solaris. I heard from the team that you've done so much to support our game. We're truly grateful.</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover</b> You're welcome, Mr. Bertolt. But what happened? Did someone attack you?</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> Ah, no, not exactly. That \"lady\" who kicked me? She's... well, she's an NPC in the Second Coming of Solaris.</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> But I never wrote that behavior tree... Why'd she act like that?</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> Could the others have changed her settings behind my back? No... they wouldn't. Wait, I know! This must be that programming error they were talking about!</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Programming error?</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> Exactly. Simply put, it's like when the game acts up or you spot bugs. Most of the time it's due to some kind of coding error, design oversight, or glitch.</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> Some players reported it before, but when we used admin accounts to debug... nothing. We couldn't replicate it.</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> So I figured maybe it only happens to player accounts. So I made one. And, well... now you know.</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;), could you please help me out? I heard you handled that whole marketing disaster during the closed beta's first anniversary... like a pro.</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> If you can help me track down these bugs, I'll handle the rest from my Terminal.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Any rewards?\n<dl><dd><b>Bertolt</b> Of course! I'll write up a proposal and send it straight to my supervisor.</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Sure, I've got time to spare.\n<dl><dd><b>Bertolt</b> I really appreciate it, (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;)!</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> Just like last time, you can log into the game through your Terminal... Huh? \"Second Coming of Solaris... Ultra?\" When did they add that to the login screen?</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> Maybe the UI team tried something new and forgot to loop me in... again.</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> Anyway, no biggie. Please log in to the game, and I'll meet you there!</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"tabber wds-tabber\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper with-bottom-border\"><ul class=\"wds-tabs\"><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\" data-hash=\"Tycoon&#39;s_Street\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Tycoon's Street</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Welcome_Resort\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Welcome Resort</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Brainpower_Room\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Brainpower Room</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Oven_Restaurant\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Oven Restaurant</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Carnivale_Fountain\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Carnivale Fountain</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Big_Haul_Dock\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Big Haul Dock</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"A-okay_Harbor\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">A-okay Harbor</a></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-content\">A certain business tycoon, whose name must not be mentioned, controls this street from the shadows. His sales campaign was aimed at winning hearts with some delicious deals. But for whatever reason, clearly things didn't go as planned.</div></div>\n<div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-content\">The test server is currently unavailable. Players participating in the beta may access the content once the maintenance concludes.</div></div>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dd><b>Bertolt</b> There you are, (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;)! I just squashed  the bug with that lady kicking people's teeth in, and ran a full analysis on the error logs.</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> Turns out, someone's actually infiltrated the Second Coming of Solaris's server and messed with the game data.</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> Problem is, they barely left a trail. If I'm going to track them down, I need error codes. A lot more.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Can I help?</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> Absolutely! Just keep an eye out for anything that looks out of place or just weird. When you spot something, snap a photo with the Zoom Camera, and I'll patch it up right away.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Wait. I've got an idea...</dd>\n<dd>You explain your plan to Bertolt.</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> You mean... we don't fix the bugs, but make them even more <i>exaggerated?</i> To draw the intruder out?</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> That's... an unhinged idea. But it could work. The intruder might think we're in on it, or get mad we're messing with their \"vision.\" Either way, it could smoke them out.</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> Besides, I can always reset everything before maintenance ends. No harm, no foul.</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> So, what do you say? Play it clean and fix the bugs? Or go full chaos and draw them out? I'll modify the data based on your call.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<h3><span id=\".5BHint:_The_most_generous_soul_in_the_Second_Coming_of_Solaris.5D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"[Hint:_The_most_generous_soul_in_the_Second_Coming_of_Solaris]\">[Hint: The most generous soul in the Second Coming of Solaris]</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dt><b>\"Mahe\"</b> Refer a friend and earn a FREE bird egg! Current progress 99.99997%!</dt>\n<dt><b>\"Mahe\"</b> LIMITED TIME DEAL! Giant discount on bird eggs, just 1499.99 Shell Credits!</dt>\n<dt><b>\"Mahe\"</b> Farm-to-table organic bird eggs! Absolutely fresh and tasty! Selling only at 1499.98 Shell Credits!</dt>\n<dt><b>Old Man</b> ...Huh? Don't all of you talk at once. I can't make sense of it...</dt></dl>\n<dl><dd><b>Bertolt</b> We wanted the shopkeeper NPCs in Tiancheng to feel more believable, so we brought in Mr. Mahe to help us out with motion and facial capture. Ahem... no insinuation here, I swear.</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> But now, thanks to the bug, there are more shopkeepers than we planned... Unfortunately, their ethics didn't scale with them.</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> What do you think we should do, (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;)?</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Let's scale it back to just one.\n<dl><dd><b>Bertolt</b> Got it. I'll handle it right away.</dd>\n<dd>Bertolt makes some modifications based on your suggestion.</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> All done, (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;). How's it looking now?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Looks great.\n<dl><dd><b>Bertolt</b> Perfect.</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Hmm... Let's try another version.\n<dl><dd><b>Bertolt</b> Want me to bump the number back up? No problem.</dd>\n<dd>Bertolt makes some modifications based on your suggestion.</dd></dl></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Honestly, I think three isn't enough...\n<dl><dd><b>Bertolt</b> Oh, I see where this is going... Alright, lemme give it a little tweak...</dd>\n<dd>Bertolt makes some modifications based on your suggestion.</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> All done, (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;). How's it looking now?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Looks great.\n<dl><dd><b>Bertolt</b> Perfect.</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Hmm... Let's try another version.\n<dl><dd><b>Bertolt</b> Going back to one shopkeeper? On it. Just give me a sec.</dd>\n<dd>Bertolt makes some modifications based on your suggestion.</dd></dl></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<dl><dt>(Clean Route)</dt>\n<dt>Why haven't the bird eggs gone on sale yet...</dt></dl>\n<dl><dt>(Chaos Route)</dt>\n<dd>There are more shopkeepers now. You were hoping it would spark some healthy competition, but instead, they all started saying the exact same thing.</dd>\n<dt><b>\"Mahe\"</b> Bird</dt>\n<dt><b>\"Mahe\"</b> Egg</dt>\n<dt><b>\"Mahe\"</b> 1</dt>\n<dt><b>\"Mahe\"</b> 5</dt>\n<dt><b>\"Mahe\"</b> 0</dt>\n<dt><b>\"Mahe\"</b> 0</dt>\n<dt><b>Old Man</b> Who am I supposed to buy from?</dt></dl>\n<hr />\n<h3><span id=\".5BHint:_It.27s_Elastiboy.21.5D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"[Hint:_It's_Elastiboy!]\">[Hint: It's Elastiboy!]</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><b>Bertolt</b> By the Sentinel, do you SEE that twisted model over there?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Yeah... It's weird.</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> This one's worth fixing. Alright, let's work on it!</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> What do you think we should do, (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;)?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Let's restore it to normal.\n<dl><dd><b>Bertolt</b> Got it. I'll handle it right away.</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Let's go even weirder.\n<dl><dd><b>Bertolt</b> Oh, I see where this is going... Alright, lemme give it a little tweak...</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Hmm... Let's try another version.\n<dl><dd>Back to normal it is. Leave it to me.</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd>Twist it even further? Okay, lemme give it a try.</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<dl><dt>(Chaos Route)</dt>\n<dd>The customers near the fruit stand have become even stranger... You decide it's best not to keep staring at them.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<h3><span id=\".5BHint:_It.27s_Pixelated_scenery_of_nostalgia.5D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"[Hint:_It's_Pixelated_scenery_of_nostalgia]\">[Hint: It's Pixelated scenery of nostalgia]</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dt><b>Man</b> What's wrong with this tree? Did something infest it or make it sick?</dt></dl>\n<dl><dd><b>Bertolt</b> Huh. Why is this tree... square? Looks like the texture mapping glitched out.</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> What do you think we should do, (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;)?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> The normal trees look more natural.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> What if we made all the trees...</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Hmm... Let's try another version.\n<dl><dd>Switching back to normal trees? No problem.</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd>Going full pixel forest? On it.</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<dl><dt>(Clean Route)</dt>\n<dt>One leaf.... Two leaves...</dt></dl>\n<dl><dt>(Chaos Route)</dt>\n<dd>As you study the odd tree, a strange thought crosses your mind, \"If I had an axe, I could get a lot of wood...\"</dd>\n<dt><b>Man</b> Something ain't right! I'd better get someone who knows their stuff to take a look...</dt></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dd><b>Bertolt</b> Looks like we've cleaned up all the bugs in this area... probably.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Any leads?</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> Not yet. But this doesn't feel like just some harmless prank.</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> I'll ask the other designers to look for signs of the intruder in other areas of the Second Coming of Solaris.</dd>\n<dd><b>Bertolt</b> We might still need your help, though. Thanks again, (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;). Until next time.</dd></dl>\n</div><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-content\">A famed hot spring resort in the Second Coming of Solaris, known for its eternal snow and familiar mountain peaks... Still, visitors always manage to discover something novel.</div></div>\n<div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-content\">The test server is currently unavailable. Players participating in the beta may access the content once the maintenance concludes.</div></div>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n</div><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-content\">The Second Coming of Solaris lore mentions a highly secretive research group, which the designers attempted to recreate their base in-game. Unfortunately, it's so well-hidden that no one really knows what it should look like.</div></div>\n<div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-content\">The test server is currently unavailable. Players participating in the beta may access the content once the maintenance concludes.</div></div>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n</div><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-content\">This restaurant draws diners from all across the Second Coming of Solaris, thanks in part to its oven Echo, which is said to hold temperatures capable of melting steel in its belly. Some say keeping it here is a waste, that it should be forging weapons, not crisping up pizzas.</div></div>\n<div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-content\">The test server is currently unavailable. Players participating in the beta may access the content once the maintenance concludes.</div></div>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n</div><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-content\">Nothing can shake the cheerful spirit of the Fountain Square folks. They sing, dance, and celebrate all day, completely unbothered by the strange happenings around them.</div></div>\n<div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-content\">The test server is currently unavailable. Players participating in the beta may access the content once the maintenance concludes.</div></div>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n</div><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-content\">Every angler dreams of landing the biggest catch. No one wans to slink home with an empty bucket while everyone's watching. The abundant fish here has brought steady profits to the nearby seafood market and earned the dock its famous name: Big Haul Dock.</div></div>\n<div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-content\">The test server is currently unavailable. Players participating in the beta may access the content once the maintenance concludes.</div></div>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n</div><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-content\">As its name suggest, all's well at A-okay Harbor. Everything's normal. Really.</div></div>\n<div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-content\">The test server is currently unavailable. Players participating in the beta may access the content once the maintenance concludes.</div></div>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n</div><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div></div></div>",
